# House Price Prediction — Linear Regression

## Objective
Built and evaluated a Linear Regression model to predict house sale prices 
based on numeric property features.

## Dataset
Ames Housing Dataset (Kaggle — House Prices: Advanced Regression Techniques)

## Tools Used
Python, pandas, scikit-learn, matplotlib, seaborn, Jupyter Notebook (VS Code)

## Approach
- Explored SalePrice distribution and missing values
- Selected numeric features, imputed missing values with median
- Trained/test split (80/20), trained Linear Regression model
- Evaluated using MSE, RMSE, R² score
- Analyzed residuals and feature coefficients

## Results
- RMSE: $36,879.82
- R² Score: 0.8227
